From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Tue, 13 Oct 2026 06:04:59 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] Guard attendance: client shift plans, QR sign-in,
 supervisor kiosk, monthly sheet

Replaces the monthly Excel time sheet.

- Shift plan per client (day guards, night guards, shift times), set on the
  client form and editable from a chosen month; history kept so earlier
  months' shortages don't change.
- QR poster per client: guards sign in with FWSS number + PIN; GPS distance
  from the site, phone binding, shift window and roster are checked, and
  anything doubtful is held for review instead of refused. Night shifts past
  midnight count for the date they started.
- Supervisor kiosk for guards without a phone: tap or scan the guard's ID
  card; supervisor's GPS checked against the site.
- Monthly grid like the Excel sheet (P/A/OFF/S/PS), per-day cover against the
  plan, per-shift shortages, review queue, Excel export.
- Absent counts only days marked absent (the sheet used 31 - present).

See docs/guard-attendance.md.

